# Corpus boundary for graphify. This repo is checked out at $HOME, so the scan
# root is $HOME and .gitignore alone is not enough: dev/, Downloads/, Library/,
# Applications/ and most other top-level directories are untracked but not
# ignored, and a bare scan walks the entire home directory.
#
# `/*/` matches root-level DIRECTORIES only, so root-level files (AGENTS.md,
# justfile, hk.pkl, .zshrc, ...) stay in the corpus. Git's parent-exclusion rule
# means a `!` line below cannot re-include anything beneath a directory excluded
# here, so Library/LaunchAgents/*.plist is deliberately out of scope.
/*/
!/.agents/
!/.claude/
!/.codex/
!/.config/
!/.cursor/
!/.gemini/
!/.github/
!/.grok/
!/.omp/
!/.opencode/
!/.pi/
!/bin/
!/crates/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/settings/
!/tests/
